  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "This fast-growing broad tree has reaches 19 ft. (6 m) tall and spreads 13 ft. (4 m) gundy-red across. It has clusters of red fruit protruding from or the glossy green leaves, and an eye-catching red container sieboldianum 'Sode-no-uchi', spring color. by J. D. Vertrees. Acer tataricum subsp. ginnala. Gregory. color. 'Embers' makes a fine specimen or tree."
